lue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Egreham, she can have more powers than that, for sure. By the way, good job on your piece. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, so what can a [Forces 1, Prime 5, Mind 3] mage can gain more?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T19:50:05-08:00","id":57842,"title":"","content":"I think you could design Miss Watson to taste, given that she is a level 5 merit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T20:14:32-08:00","id":58484,"title":"","content":"For the first part of the game, each player gets three experience and two arcane experience. I think everyone did very well. I really am impressed. I am quite looking forward to seening what happens next.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T00:17:01-08:00","id":62755,"title":"","content":"Ok, so this is the concept of Miss Watson based on our character template.<br /> <br /> Name: Katleen Ulestra<br /> Shadow Name: Miss Watson<br /> <br /> Virtue:<br /> Vice:<br /> <br /> Highest: Intelligence<br /> Lowest: Presence<br /> <br /> Ally(Free Council) ***<br /> Status (Arrow) ***<br /> Resources ***<br /> Sactum *<br /> Sniping ****<br /> Retainer(Hei) *****<br /> <br /> Arcana: Mind 3, Space 1, Prime 5<br /> Path: Mastigos<br /> Order: Adamantine Arrow<br /> <br /> Background Notes:<br /> <br /> She is one of the rare few Awakened with Awakened parents.<br /> <br /> She suffers guilt from an incident involving abuse of Mind against ignorant sleeper friends.<br /> <br /> Made friends who later went with the Free Council, almost joining them because of her technological aptitude.<br /> <br /> Mentor is dead.<br /> <br /> _______<br /> <br /> <br /> I first thought to give her the Abyssal Scope after reading what Durandal was and thought &quot;that's cool&quot;, but I decided against it. Instead, I had Miss Watson be equally invested in Hei as Hei is to her so that now I have a duel character. Haven't decided on Virtue/Vice yet. Will work on background story.<br /> <br /> Also, changing Hei's Vice to Glutton. (more of indulgences rather than food)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T18:33:11-08:00","id":63205,"title":"","content":"Sounds great! Also I want to change my experience award from 3/2 to 6/3 as &quot;chapters&quot; I think will prove very eventful. Sorry for the confussion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T21:37:05-08:00","id":63759,"title":"","content":"As of note, I changed Miss Watson from an Obrimos to Mastigos, which means she doesn't have Forces, which means she didn't cast that Control Heat from the prologue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T20:55:36-08:00","id":65368,"title":"","content":"I have the next thing ready to go, but I need permission from Esuna to take over the interrogation part, and he hasn't message me back yet, so I'm waiting here where he can't miss it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T16:48:46-08:00","id":66070,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>egreham</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/46721-ooc-mage-the-awakening-after-the-2003-hoax?p=65368#post65368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have the next thing ready to go, but I need permission from Esuna to take over the interrogation part, and he hasn't message me back yet, so I'm waiting here where he can't miss it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry about that Egreham. I've been planning a trip. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I've sent you a PM that I hope will help. As far as I'm concerned you can do no wrong.<br /> <br /> Cire, so we've gotten 6 xp and 3 arcane xp? I think I might take the time to flesh out Hoplite a bit more. It'll be easier to play him if I know his skills, weaknesses, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2029-esuna","name":"Esuna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2029_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T17:03:13-08:00","id":66085,"title":"","content":"Esuna: correct. I should give extra dots for skills, but I'm not sure how many to give. Hmmm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-06T19:59:58-08:00","id":66934,"title":"","content":"I don't think we should go into skills. That would require us to chunk out the entire character sheet","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-06T20:21:29-08:00","id":66945,"title":"","content":"Egreham, I tend to agree with you about skills. However, people may flesh them out to taste for their own purposes if they wish, obviously.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-07T11:41:05-08:00","id":67299,"title":"","content":"I have a question. This PbP game is labelled with &quot;Mage the Ascension&quot;, but it appears you are using Awakening? I am asking because it is virtually impossible to find Ascension games anymore, sadly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PbrO9Kq.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2211-sixfootchicken","name":"SixFootChicken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"559"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-08T08:07:32-08:00","id":67899,"title":"","content":"It is an Awakening game. I am so sorry for having created false hope. May you find what you seek.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T02:17:36-08:00","id":71878,"title":"","content":"@Esuna<br /> <br /> UPDATE!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T02:43:18-08:00","id":73113,"title":"","content":"Halfway I was writing the whole betrayal drama with Hei and Hoplite from Hei's and Miss Watson's perspectives, I was like &quot;... Why are they go so far when they have enough evidence already? I forgot what they were supposed to get from playing their little Prohibition murder thing.&quot; Then I realized I didn't want to scrap it so I did anyways.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T13:21:40-08:00","id":73332,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>egreham</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/46721-ooc-mage-the-awakening-after-the-2003-hoax?p=73113#post73113\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Halfway I was writing the whole betrayal drama with Hei and Hoplite from Hei's and Miss Watson's perspectives, I was like &quot;... Why are they go so far when they have enough evidence already? I forgot what they were supposed to get from playing their little Prohibition murder thing.&quot; Then I realized I didn't want to scrap it so I did anyways.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like it too. I just figured they were pushing to make sure he wasn't going Mad, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2029-esuna","name":"Esuna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2029_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T23:27:52-08:00","id":73577,"title":"","content":"Great stuff! It will be great to see what happens!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T16:37:51-08:00","id":77872,"title":"","content":"<b>Bio update</b><br /> <br /> <b>Hannae Li</b><br /> &quot;Hei&quot;<br /> Age: 26<br /> <br /> <b>Katleen Ulestra</b><br /> \u201cMiss Watson\u201d<br /> Location: Canada<br /> Age: 20-ish<br /> Order: Adamantine Arrow<br /> Virtue: unknown<br /> Vice: Envy<br /> <br /> Katleen was a single child living with her maternal family due to her father\u2019s absence. Due to her mother\u2019s family\u2019s negative view of her vagabond father, she was either sympathized as a victim of the whole affair or alienated as a child born under non-matrimonial circumstances. Although not mistreated, Katleen was alone, and kept mostly to herself, to her mother, and to her books from the family private collection, her (temporary) favorites being Conan Doyle\u2019s Sherlock.<br /> <br /> When Katleen was 14, she became lost in the woods and when night fell, descended into the Pandemonium. Soon after returning back from Awakening, she stumbled into wolves. Details aside, it drove her grandmother into a heart attack when Katleen came home at dawn with a pack of wolves at her side. When her father came back with his rare visits, it did not escape his attention that his biological daughter now controlled the supernal arts. He gave her the choice of apprenticeship at the cost of leaving her mother behind. Curious and tempted at the possibility of power, Katleen left with her father whom she trained under and entered the society of mages. She naturally joined the Adamantine Arrow as her father/mentor was.<br /> <br /> Unsatisfied with a living centered on the politics of sorcerers, she left her father in interest of \u201cdiversifying her experience\u201d and entered a prestigious mortal university suggested by her Free Council friends - or associates as she would call them. She studied for a major in technology, secretly tinkering with the combination of magic and machinery. However, after being released from a police investigation concerning bouts of suicides, she quitted the university and disappeared. Her father hired an Interfector to track her down and bring her back.<br /> <br /> She was discovered in a state of disarray. She went through 4 mortal psychiatrists, all of them turned back less than a month, and outright refused when suggested a mage psychiatrist. Only after returning back to her mother and recuperating with her for almost a year did she come back to mage society. Soon after, she came across a struggling mage name Hei, whom she becomes partner with for the next 3 years. They later move base together to New Zealand as an operation force.<br /> <br /> (Possible NPC just because)<br /> <br /> <b>Frederick von Gregore III</b><br /> Mortal Name: \u201cHarris Maxwell Sr\u201d<br /> Shadow Name: \u201cDutch\u201d<br /> Order: Guardian of the Veil<br /> <br /> Not actually Dutch, but adopted the nickname in amusement of an assumption that he was one.<br /> A renowned Interfector in the Washington \u201csector\u201d<br /> Adopted Otti and named him Harris.<br /> <br /> <b>Otti</b><br /> Mortal Name: \u201cHarris Maxwell Jr\u201d/\u201dJunior\u201d<br /> Shadow Name: \u201cHarris\u201d<br /> Order: unknown<br /> <br /> Suspected of insanity because of his magic vision.<br /> Adopted by Dutch<br /> Rescued Hannae and prevented a school shooting<br /> <br /> *something I just did for fun)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-25T20:59:57-08:00","id":79926,"title":"","content":"@Esuna<br /> <br /> Update. With this passage going on, I would like to finish this conversation in one big lump by knowing beforehand what questions will Hoplite ask Miss Watson.<br /> <br /> As far as I know, Miss Watson will ask how Hoplite will care for his lodging and about his trauma.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T17:37:20-08:00","id":81336,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>egreham</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/46721-ooc-mage-the-awakening-after-the-2003-hoax?p=79926#post79926\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">@Esuna<br /> <br /> Update. With this passage going on, I would like to finish this conversation in one big lump by knowing beforehand what questions will Hoplite ask Miss Watson.<br /> <br /> As far as I know, Miss Watson will ask how Hoplite will care for his lodging and about his trauma.</div> </div> </div> </div>Demeanor-wise, Miss Watson's going to find him to be distracted and contemplative. The room will stink of magic, and his aura will be calm but determined.<br /> <br /> Hrm, a list of questions.<br /> <br /> &quot;Who and what are you and Hei, exactly? How do you know Obadiah?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Who are the Guardians? Seers? The Free Council?&quot; (the last one delivered with some shame, since he feels he should know better)<br /> <br /> &quot;Whom should I seek out, and whom should I avoid?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Is there anyone who can teach me... better control?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Why are you here, in New Zealand, anyway? What's driving you?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;How am I to reach you?&quot;<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> As far as lodging, he has enough to cover the next two weeks, and he already has the classifieds open and strewn about the bed. As for his trauma, he's used it in the past and been used by it. Attempting to control it has worked poorly, and avoiding it has been even worse. He's determined to face it. He hates it, and he's terrified that it's going to escape him someday and become something... real.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2029-esuna","name":"Esuna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2029_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T21:26:22-08:00","id":83749,"title":"","content":"Lovely post today, egreham. ^_^ Sorry to make you write so much, but conversations do seem to work out better this way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2029-esuna","name":"Esuna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2029_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T22:51:37-08:00","id":83788,"title":"","content":"It does seem to be a great method.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-04T13:38:47-08:00","id":84201,"title":"","content":"Now where to go...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-05T18:08:25-08:00","id":84967,"title":"","content":"Hoplite gonna get a job and get paid. Any suggestions? I'm guessing dots in mind and space would make a good private investigator.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2029-esuna","name":"Esuna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2029_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-05T20:55:28-08:00","id":85062,"title":"","content":"That sounds good, but setting up might take time. Not that presents any trouble.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-05T21:36:34-08:00","id":85089,"title":"","content":"Is there any non-spoiler reasons as to why Hei is connected with the Zodkin sword? The reason I had for Hei mentioning Zodkin was that their investigation on the Seer named Jones Codex and his mysterious mission reveals keywords regarding to the main focus of the story - which happens to be &quot;chess&quot; and &quot;Zodkin&quot; - upon their crackdown on his database.<br /> <br /> Also, I was humoring the idea of killing Hei when Miss Watson was coming back.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/46721-ooc-mage-the-awakening-after-the-2003-hoax?p=83788#post83788\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It does seem to be a great method.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's an okay method. It only works though when there is a clear purpose of the conversation and absolute guarantee that it won't get interrupted. Also, exchange of words between any more than two characters become exponentially complicated. The only way I can see that working without the laboriously long waits between each responsive posts is an IRC chat.<br /> <br /> I utilized the method because I believed I had a good grasp of Hoplite's general vocabulary and behavior. But I have to confess that it was also out of fear that other people wouldn't get Hei and/or Miss Watson right.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","user":"egreham","date":". 03-06-2014, 12:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-06T14:27:37-08:00","id":85634,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Esuna</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/46721-ooc-mage-the-awakening-after-the-2003-hoax?p=84967#post84967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hoplite gonna get a job and get paid. Any suggestions? I'm guessing dots in mind and space would make a good private investigator.</div> </div> </div> </div>End Act 1: Hoplite Is Intentionally Put In Trouble.<br /> <br /> Begin Act 2: Hoplite Is Intentionally Put In Trouble Again.<br /> <br /> Today you scrummaged up some cardboard from the dumpster, stole a marker from the local kindergarten, and rented a table and a chair from the hostel you are residing in. You need quick money, which means that you need quick jobs. You decide that the park would suit as an ideal area to harvest clients with missing items. You set up the table and lean the cardboard with Very Good Private Investigators written in green. Some little boy is probably going to cry on the missing grass in his picture, but you don't care because you are currently possessed by your Id. And as the scumbag Id, you are about to deliberately increase the number of your client. But before you can abuse your supernal gift, one of the park security approaches you with a radio holstered on his hips. He's fondling that radio with hands in the most threatening manner possible.<br /> <br /> &quot;You got a license for that? Hold on, do you even have a work visa on our country?&quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\"> *</span><br /> <br /> You don't hesitate to mindfuck him away from your precious booth, and you are left alone in your maniacal devices. Coincidentally, Miss Watson was taking a walk near the park after submitting her report and making the appointment for her next meeting with the Provosts to defend Hoplite's right to stay when she saw a guard curiously tainted by an aura she was intimately familiar with not 24 hours ago. It didn't take long before Miss Watson assessed the situation and suffered 1x facepalm damage.<br /> <br /> Miss Watson weaves a hidden, impenetrable protection from magic on guard and send him in your direction. She fancied the idea that she was teaching you an unforgettable lesson on the moral she preached to you the night before, but really, she just did it to fuck with you, thus invoking her vice Envy and taking a willpower. She makes a note to herself that she is going to bail you out tomorrow and giggles her way out the stage.<br /> <br /> When you try your magic with the guard again, he quickly catches onto your bullshit and calls the police on you. Even more coincidentally, Hei was looking for you to make you owe her lunches before you can get a job and comes just in time to see you get inside the popo car. She then devices Operation Break Hoplite's Ass Outta Prison, OBHAOP for short, and proceeds to &quot;infiltrate&quot; whatever police station you land on. She invokes her vice of Gluttony, or indulgences for incredibly-stupid-and-dangerous-in-retrospect thrills, and gains a willpower.<br /> <br /> By the time you gain back control of your own body, you find yourself in front of a desk housing a very suspicious police officer. You work your literal magic in order to get out of this mess and do a pretty good job with an insanity plea. However coincidentally, there happened to be a gumshoe mage hanging around in this station who detects your supernal activity and finds you utterly suspicious and concludes that you are most likely a Seer. He takes over your case and &quot;volunteers&quot; to drive you back home.<br /> <br /> During the entire time, Hei was walking around invisible searching for you and suddenly sees you put into a car by a mage that she knows has no knowledge of you and knocks him out with one blow. Before anyone can see, Hei throws the mage in the shotgun seat and proceeds to unveil herself and drives with a temporarily borrowed police cap on her head. She drops you at your hostel to go yell &quot;fuck the police&quot; in a police car in a more private area and return it before the owner becomes conscious again.<br /> <br /> You are at least thankful that the chain of Dramatic Failures you incurred while fighting your Id promises you months in your &quot;Days Since Last Accident&quot; counter hanging in your mental storage room. Of course, that is a logical fallacy.<br /> <br /> End Act 2<br /> Reap instant EXP!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">*= the sentence that started this all.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","user":"egreham","date":". 03-06-2014, 05:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-06T20:29:42-08:00","id":85802,"title":"","content":"Egreham: I rumored the connection between the sword and Hei to merely work toward connecting the two &quot;arms&quot; of this game. Maybe she does have the sword by then or maybe she does not. Either way, Silencer is going to be looking for her. James Codex - sounds like a great villian!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-06T20:34:34-08:00","id":85806,"title":"","content":"Egreham, you have a gift for writing in the second person, just so you know. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-06T21:08:19-08:00","id":85822,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/46721-ooc-mage-the-awakening-after-the-2003-hoax?p=85802#post85802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Egreham: I rumored the connection between the sword and Hei to merely work toward connecting the two &quot;arms&quot; of this game. Maybe she does have the sword by then or maybe she does not. Either way, Silencer is going to be looking for her. James Codex - sounds like a great villian!</div> </div> </div> </div>Jones &quot;Codex&quot;. Also, he was the rat who got caught, so I don't see how he's going to an important villain, but oh well.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/46721-ooc-mage-the-awakening-after-the-2003-hoax?p=85802#post85802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Egreham, you have a gift for writing in the second person, just so you know. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>2nd person isn't that much different 3rd person or 1st person. I simply got inspiration from MSPaintFanAdventures that has lists of fan webcomic based around the technique of narrating as if the reader was the character inspired by Homestuck.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-08T15:05:28-08:00","id":87030,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>egreham</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/46721-ooc-mage-the-awakening-after-the-2003-hoax?p=85634#post85634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;You got a license for that? Hold on, do you even have a work visa on our country?&quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\"> *</span><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Hoplite stares dourly at the pretty and pleasant customs and immigration officer at Auckland International Airport. The flight had been long. The peanuts had been salty. The drinks had ran out somewhere over the Pacific. The morbidly obese man sitting next to him had smelled like a combination of liniment and Stilton cheese. <br /> <br /> &quot;How long will you be staying in the country?&quot; she asked.<br /> <br /> &quot;Two weeks.&quot; he replied.<br /> <br /> &quot;Business or pleasure?&quot;<br /> <br /> Hoplite leaned in and whispered conspiratorially.<br /> <br /> &quot;Wizardry.&quot;<br /> <br /> The woman didn't even raise an eyebrow. She stamped his passport and handed it back to him.<br /> <br /> &quot;Keep it secret, keep it safe.&quot; She whispered.<br /> <br /> -------<br /> <br /> If he can't get a job, I'm not sure how I'm going to keep him from suffering an ignominious death by starvation. Do they even *have* hobos in New Zealand?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2029-esuna","name":"Esuna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2029_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-08T17:57:17-08:00","id":87113,"title":"","content":"I might have a solution. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-08T18:10:21-08:00","id":87117,"title":"","content":"The Act 2 is just a fanfic piece. You guys are clamoring it to make it canon, and I am okay with that; but please keep in mind that it was written just for hilarity. It's just that I have no idea where the story is going in its attempt to fit my &quot;Act 2&quot; thing in. Especially now that I don't have anything to write on.<br /> <br /> I immensely enjoy the creative freedom, but I can't help but feel that I'm given the charge of being the GM of myself. It's a bit taxing to try to calculate how to make my original arcs dependent on the main storyline and avoid any paradoxical derailment. I guess it's nice to have anything I say be canon, but since that means whatever I say dictates the canon. I feel like I'm writing for a world that wasn't mine to begin with.<br /> <br /> I wish that you would share your vision of this story; even if it means saying what will happen in advance and having to conform my arc to these results. Of course, if you are simply posting bit by bit, that's fine. I want to know, however, at which point am I involved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","user":"egreham","date":". 03-08-2014, 09:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-08T18:23:52-08:00","id":87122,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/45831-ic-mage-the-awakening-after-the-2003-hoax?p=87114#post87114\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Psychos replied, &quot;I do, my dear, but not for the reason that you might imagine. I want you to charge that American - Hoplite - with investigating the Adamant Sage. We must find out if he really is a Seer of the Throne or not. This is something I cannot trust to any of my usual people.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;What about me?&quot; the woman asked, almost pouting. &quot;Surely you know I would do this for you? Or anything else that you might ask?&quot;<br /> <br /> Psychos shook his head. &quot;He would maybe expect me to turn to you. It will be better to use Hoplite. Besides, he needs a job.&quot; He chuckled at this observation, and then added, &quot;You may pay him as you see fit.&quot;<br /> <br /> The woman bowed her head. &quot;As you say.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Also I want you to talk to Lilly,&quot; said Psychos. &quot;Tell her we need to keep Miss Watson and Hei from leaving my domain. If Hoplite does discover that, the Adamant Sage, it might be necessary to use them to take care of him. I doubt any locals could be trusted to go up against him.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/KKgI96M.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Assigning Hoplite with ... investigating THE Adamantine Sage? Even if it's AN Adamantine Sage, he's still a Master and of the highest social standings and is not Free Council.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","user":"egreham","date":". 03-08-2014, 09:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-08T21:22:52-08:00","id":87207,"title":"","content":"Egreham: I totally see what you are saying. I do not mean to lead so poorly. Things have just gone in an unexpected way due to RL seemingly claiming several players at least for now. That said, with the people now playing I think I will focus on the Seer hunt at least for the time being. As to Hoplite's weird assignment, it is just that Psychos considers him expendable. I should also note that the Adamant Sage is not actually a seer. As to my main plan, I think RL events of tabled that at least for now. However, I plan to work Silencer in case it is ever untabled and so I have an NPC to work with to help with the story.<br /> <br /> All that said, I mostly making it up as I go along, especially now. However, that might not be a bad thing. It leaves us open to doing anything that we might find interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-08T21:35:17-08:00","id":87214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>egreham</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/46721-ooc-mage-the-awakening-after-the-2003-hoax?p=87117#post87117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Act 2 is just a fanfic piece. You guys are clamoring it to make it canon, and I am okay with that; but please keep in mind that it was written just for hilarity.</div> </div> </div> </div>I get that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I figure what happens in the OOC thread stays in the OOC thread. That said, finding working in a country where you're on a tourist visa is a legitimate thing for me to consider. I actually found <a href=\"http://www.immigration.govt.nz/migrant/stream/work/worktemporarily/requirements/quickcheck/\" target=\"_blank\">this helpful chart</a>. I'm amused that they call out &quot;Specialist Thai Chef&quot; and &quot;Jockey&quot;. <br /> <br /> My new goal in this game is to somehow arrange for Hei to drive a stolen cop car. Or the General Lee.<br /> <br /> As for investigating the Adamant Sage, I just figure Hoplite's being set up for a spectacular failure. Which could be heaps of fun. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2029-esuna","name":"Esuna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2029_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-11T16:25:13-07:00","id":89099,"title":"","content":"Psychosis is an arsehole. Thats really the reason. Oh and his burning love for all things free council. <br /> <br /> I'm still around but as Cire mentioned, real life kicked me in the teeth, but you've not seen the last of Scar. At least I hope not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1510-mysticjackal","name":"MysticJackal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"116"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T23:00:54-07:00","id":91420,"title":"","content":"Just came back from college Midterm. I'm assuming that's what everyone's been up to .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-15T18:52:17-07:00","id":92018,"title":"","content":"So ... are we waiting for someone to post something on IC to jumpstart the plot again?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-15T20:44:31-07:00","id":92076,"title":"","content":"Yes, I should do that! I will very soon. I hope your tests went well. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-19T12:49:20-07:00","id":94394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/45831-ic-mage-the-awakening-after-the-2003-hoax?p=93283#post93283\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mouse then ventured deeper into the warren that was his sanctum. He returned later with a sword splendid with magic. &quot;Is that one of Zodakin's swords?&quot; asked Dawn in clear awe.<br /> <br /> Mouse smiled proudly. &quot;It was, but now is yours. I stole it six years ago, and not even Psychosis knew that I had this all this time. I decided that it was the only thing that would be a fitting gift for one like you.&quot;<br /> <br /> Dawn smiled. &quot;You are too kind, Mouse.&quot;<br /> <br /> \u200bDawn was pleased with herself. The advice she had received to <b>befriend </b>Mouse had certainly paid off!</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Befriend</b><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.quickmeme.com/img/ab/abb02642db9d4002d951ffcad7da02b7f80a973a830406e970b1d521b4d3e8e9.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Behold the magic of friendship, bitches.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://img2.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20121117231842/mlp/images/a/ae/Mouse_offering_cheese_to_Pinkie_clone_S3E3.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Although I have one complaint:<br /> <img src=\"http://i771.photobucket.com/albums/xx356/prettifer/gifs/MovedPics238-1.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> If you like it you don't put a fucking sword on it, Mouse you dumbass","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-19T13:56:35-07:00","id":94443,"title":"","content":"It is true that Mouse might not be the most clever mage that ever lived.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-19T18:45:57-07:00","id":94602,"title":"","content":"Sorry, been in development hell for a week. I'll get caught up momentarily. What's the plan, Cire?<br /> <br /> *edit - Is it still a few days until April 12? If so, I reckon' Hoplite has a few days to go find more trouble.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2029,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2029-esuna","user":"Esuna","date":".  Additional question 03-19-2014, 09:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2029-esuna","name":"Esuna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2029_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-20T08:44:16-07:00","id":94963,"title":"","content":"Yes he does. I expect the one Mouse knows as Dawn will seek Hoplite out. Lilly will also be trying to get Miss Watson and Hei to stay put. It should be fun. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-30T22:12:20-07:00","id":102393,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"http://31.media.tumblr.com/tumblr_lu7j57tFwG1qjgyuwo1_500.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Lily: If you could just stay in the city that would be great.<br /> <br /> Hei: WHERE THE FUCK WOULD WE GO.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-01T08:09:07-07:00","id":103399,"title":"","content":"I will have to work on this. Egreham, I tried to send you a PM and will try again later to explain my thoughts on the mystery text,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":790,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","user":"Cire","date":".  Problems 04-01-2014, 11:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-10T21:18:03-07:00","id":110574,"title":"","content":"We used to be the greatest thread in this forum. Now a Werewolf eats us ahead and another is Exalted beyond us.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://data3.whicdn.com/images/83905094/thumb.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T12:07:13-07:00","id":110970,"title":"","content":"Those were the days indeed!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-26T13:50:20-07:00","id":119948,"title":"","content":"Man, if Esuna left and it's just me, that would be really sad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-27T04:54:53-07:00","id":120292,"title":"","content":"Evan Olefurn<br /> Shadow Name: Obadiah<br /> Mortal Name: Obadiah<br /> Order: Free Council<br /> Path: Thrysus<br /> <br /> South African. Adopted into an English family.<br /> <br /> A doctor in study, and considers himself something of a spirit(ual) emissary<br /> <br /> A devout Protestant. Believes that the Fall was induced when humanity took a power that it was not ready for it yet, and that the path to redemption to God lies in proving that they are capable of handling.<br /> <br /> Was briefly in romantic relationship with Katleen, which was suspended because of conflicting religious belief.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","user":"egreham","date":". 04-29-2014, 02:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T16:22:31-07:00","id":122747,"title":"","content":"I actually have to forgo writing anything until next Tuesday. I wasn't able to finish my post as I promised mainly because I have a role in a play that's in very soon.<br /> <br /> But I've also been writing side short stories that would serve as background for my characters. One about Obadiah and Miss Watson, and the other about Miss Watson and Dutch (the guy who recruited Hei into the Pentacle society), and a little draft about the first encounter between Hei and Miss Watson. I'm planning to finish the Obadiah/Miss Watson arc and then promptly finish the latter part of the current events.<br /> <br /> Laters. Until then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-05T07:30:35-07:00","id":125788,"title":"","content":"I very much look forward to it. I hope the play went great!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T21:06:29-07:00","id":157409,"title":"","content":"Hello, I'm back again. I'm sorry to say I have not made much progress on Hei arc, or even the Obadiah/MissWatson arc I promised. I had to spend a lot of time on writing an independent short story that was originally for homework which I intend to finish, and now I am seized by the priority of college. That's not to say that I haven't been dicking around a lot, especially reading fanfictions or just lying in bed. I just wanted to put a notice here because this thread and story, which I have enjoyed investing much time in, looked so pitiful without any update from anyone. I've seen so many things stop without news, fading to obscurity like a lonely old man who died in his house only to be found years later, that I feel a conclusion (or a proper beheading) is needed.<br /> <br /> Winchester, Doolittle, Scar, Oberon, Willow, and Lars disappeared without trace, and it seemed it was only Hei/Miss Watson duo and Hoplite, then he was gone too (I think).<br /> <br /> I really like the story, and I really enjoyed writing about Hei and Miss Watson and loved fleshing out their persons and history. I also had tons of fleeting ideas about the characters that they interacted with like Obadiah, Dutch, and even Otti, and because of this, the whole mage arc will have a special place in my heart (which I mean my writing history).<br /> <br /> However, the story of Tuesday's endeavor to bring a motley crew of mages to collect all the Chess so she could marry her step brother could never be shortened to a length in which I would be comfortable to trudge alone. Hei and Miss Watson couldn't possibly pick up the quest where Tuesday and her hired cohorts have left, and they haven't even been made relevant to each other yet! I'll miss writing a couple of scenes that I really wanted to write, but it isn't enough to look forward to writing half of a short novel.<br /> <br /> So what will happen now? After all, this project is yours, Cire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1111-egreham","name":"egreham","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T21:27:41-07:00","id":157455,"title":"","content":"Oh god, I can't believe I forgot about this. <br /> <br /> Have subscription e-mails just started working?<br /> <br /> I'm back, if you lot aren't too pissed...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2029-esuna","name":"Esuna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2029_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T23:25:05-07:00","id":158757,"title":"","content":"My thought is that the Tuesday part should be forgotten. I think we should focus on Auckland for the time being at least. Perhaps we should even start over, albeit in the same setting. If half a novel is to be written, it should be about the remaining player's characters. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T07:56:15-07:00","id":159044,"title":"","content":"I'm interested either way. I'd like to see where Hoplite ends up, but I really like making characters, too. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2029-esuna","name":"Esuna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2029_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T11:27:28-07:00","id":159224,"title":"","content":"As tpo Winchester, I'd like to apologize for disappearing the way I did. I was all eager to get started, and then I got a smidge busy--I think--and for a while I was trying to figure out what to do and what to write about being in New Zealand.<br /> <br /> And then I was gone long enough that I looked up, a month had passed since my last post, I had no idea what was going on, I wasn't sure who was still in the game, and I figured there was no real point in even trying to come back. And now we're 3-4 months after that, and, well, again, I'm sorry. I'm not asking to come back, as I can't guarantee that this wouldn't happen again even if I did.<br /> <br /> For the record: Oberon's player went from a temporary ban for an aggressive, profanity-laced post on the Exalted forums to a permanent ban when it turned out that he was a poster who had been permanently banned from the old forums.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T09:43:11-07:00","id":160035,"title":"","content":"Mockery, I'd love to hav